      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks, that's a good start. some of these are a bit generic though. can you expand on the part about the disproportionate impact on mid-sized companies? i want to show the reps that the big guys can afford this but we can't. also, what's the counter-argument from the people pushing these regs? i need to know what they're gonna throw at me so i can shut it down.",
